WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:07.520
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a British psychological thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Exam.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:21.120
At the beginning of the movie, eight candidates&nbsp;
are shown getting ready for a hiring examination&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:26.960
for a profitable corporate job. Some candidates&nbsp;
motivate themselves with encouraging words,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.040
while some add a few touch-ups to their&nbsp;
appearances before moving to the examination&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:37.360
hall. The place is dimly lit with desks for every&nbsp;
candidate kept uniformly throughout the room.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.400
It also has cameras to monitor their activities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.680
After the eight of them are seated, a guard with a&nbsp;
gun enters the room, visibly making the candidates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.920
nervous. He is followed by a man who doesn’t tell&nbsp;
them his name and simply introduces himself as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:57.280
invigilator. He then apologizes to them for the&nbsp;
hardships they have faced to reach this room,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:01.680
revealing that the candidates have passed&nbsp;
all the previous hiring processes and are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:07.680
the finalists. If they pass this last test, they&nbsp;
will be getting the jobs of their dreams. 
&nbsp;

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:12.000
As the “rule” of the test, the&nbsp;
invigilator claims that no federal law&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.960
applies inside the examination hall and the&nbsp;
candidates are supposed to follow only the law&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:22.560
of the exam. They are not allowed to communicate&nbsp;
with the guard or the invigilator. Similarly, if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:27.920
they ruin the paper intentionally or accidentally&nbsp;
and if they walk out of the room for any reason,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:33.440
they will be disqualified. The candidate will have&nbsp;
eighty minutes to complete the test. There is only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:38.400
one question on the paper before them that they&nbsp;
need to answer. The invigilator then asks them if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:44.480
they have any questions. When no one answers, he&nbsp;
wishes them luck, starts the timer, and walks out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:49.360
The candidates turn their respective papers&nbsp;
around and see that it is completely blank.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:55.360
All of them look at each other in confusion. 
As time passes, they get more nervous. Hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.360 --> 00:02:00.720
candidate number two starts writing on her paper&nbsp;
why she thinks she is eligible for the job. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:05.520
camera in the room zooms into her paper and&nbsp;
the guard is told to throw her out because she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:10.960
ruined her paper. Number two begs for a second&nbsp;
chance as the guard locks the doors on her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:16.000
A while later, number five realizes that the&nbsp;
rule says they cannot talk to the invigilator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.720
and the guard, which means they can talk to&nbsp;
each other. He tells the others the same thing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:24.400
making them believe that they will have to&nbsp;
work together to find what the question is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:28.400
before they find the answer. The group&nbsp;
discusses several ways they can pass the test,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:36.080
but all of them are just as confused. Throughout&nbsp;
this, candidate number one doesn’t speak at all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:41.040
One man tries to introduce himself but number five&nbsp;
suggests they give each other pet names so they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:45.760
wouldn’t have to reveal their true identity. 
He goes on to name candidate number one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:50.640
Deaf because he hasn’t spoken yet. Then,&nbsp;
the guys are named brown, black, and white&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:55.360
according to their race, and the girls are named&nbsp;
blonde, brunette, and dark, according to their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.360 --> 00:03:00.080
hair color. After that, White suggests they get&nbsp;
up from their seats because there is no such rule&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:05.520
that says that cannot. He takes a chance and gets&nbsp;
up. To everyone's delight, the guard stays put,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:09.760
meaning that they can move around freely. Dark&nbsp;
believes that the questions are written down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:15.440
on paper with invisible ink or a watermark. They&nbsp;
all agree to test the theory but do not know how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:20.560
to. Dark then gets up and uses the lights in the&nbsp;
room to see if something is written on the paper.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:25.200
However, nothing is visible. She still&nbsp;
insists everyone check their own because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:29.840
the question could be in just one of them. 
Everyone does as she says except for Deaf who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:35.040
stays quietly in his seat. White takes his paper&nbsp;
and checks it in the light. When they do not get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:41.280
any results, Black suggests the writings might&nbsp;
be visible in UV rays or x-rays. The group then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:46.160
starts looking for a switchboard to see if there&nbsp;
is an option to turn on other kinds of lights.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.560
When they do not find one, they start to&nbsp;
look for the source of such light themselves.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:55.440
Deaf doesn’t help them whatsoever and nervously&nbsp;
stays on his seat. Blonde finds strips of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.440 --> 00:04:00.320
emergency lights in the room. But since there are&nbsp;
no switches, the group has to break all the other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:06.000
light bulbs to create an emergency and trigger the&nbsp;
lights. Brown retaliates saying that they cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.600
take such a risk. So, they vote on the matter and&nbsp;
eventually decide to go forth with the plan. 
&nbsp;

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.280
After breaking all the light bulbs&nbsp;
in the room, it suddenly glows blue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:19.680
because of the emergency black light. Everyone&nbsp;
starts to look for the question in the paper,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:24.080
except for Deaf. But they are disappointed&nbsp;
again because they cannot see the question.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:28.480
Brunette asks everyone to remove the first layer&nbsp;
of the strip light because they aren’t lit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.520
This might give rise to UV rays which can&nbsp;
help them. They use the woman’s heels to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:38.320
break the strips and reveal another form&nbsp;
of light. However, they are again met with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:44.240
disappointment because these lights do not work&nbsp;
either. Now the group only has sixty minutes left.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:49.440
A frustrated White asks everyone to think of&nbsp;
alternatives. As they brainstorm ideas, White&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:54.720
registers that they can do anything to number&nbsp;
2’s paper since she is already disqualified. 
&nbsp;

00:04:54.720 --> 00:05:00.560
So, they gather around her desk and try tracing&nbsp;
the paper with a pencil. Still, no question comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:05.200
forth. White then tears her paper into sections&nbsp;
so that they can use them to experiment with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:09.760
different methods. Next, he pees on one of&nbsp;
the papers to see if it is liquid-activated.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:15.200
However, that doesn’t work either. Black and&nbsp;
White get into a heated argument while discussing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:21.280
what they should do next but they stop after&nbsp;
hearing Deaf cry. He sobs silently in his seat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:26.480
while the others watch him in amusement. After&nbsp;
that, the man starts to blabber in French. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:31.280
asks them if they can see something in the paper&nbsp;
and claims that the paper reflects their image.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:35.600
They do not think much about his blabberings&nbsp;
and get back into discussing ideas. 
&nbsp;

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:41.040
Everyone falls dead silent when Brown speaks. He&nbsp;
proposes a theory of his own claiming that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:46.320
are not in an exam but are in some kind of betting&nbsp;
show. The board members of the company have placed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:50.720
bets on who will crack under pressure and the&nbsp;
sole purpose of them being there is for their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:57.440
entertainment. Dark thinks that the board members&nbsp;
probably have better things to do with their time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:02.000
but according to Brown, money is the least of&nbsp;
their concerns. With the amount of money they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:07.120
in their life, the board members probably live&nbsp;
for the risks. Now, everyone comes forward with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:11.680
their own ideas. Some claim that the invigilator&nbsp;
might be behind this while others say it might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:17.040
be the CEO. They begin to crack under pressure&nbsp;
and insult each other. Brunette confidently says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:22.320
that there are no people watching them because the&nbsp;
CEO is hands-on in the company. He has all of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:26.800
company’s rights and power over everyone. 
It is clear that she knows more about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:32.160
company than anyone else. Brown asks her how she&nbsp;
knows so much about the CEO. It turns out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:37.920
Brunette is already working for the company&nbsp;
in HR but has never seen the CEO. She applied&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:42.320
for a higher job and now she is here.&nbsp;
White then reveals that he was headhunted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:46.880
and offered the job. But the others say that they&nbsp;
applied for it. However, one thing they have in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:51.120
common is that they do not know anything&nbsp;
about the company and what it does because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:55.360
they were told not to ask any questions. 
Brunette then explains that they are applying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.360 --> 00:07:01.520
for a famous multi-million Pharmaceutical company&nbsp;
called Birog. A few years ago when a pandemic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:06.240
spread among young people of the world, they&nbsp;
were the first ones to find the cure. Currently,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:12.480
their yearly turnover is $20 billion dollars, all&nbsp;
because of their CEO. Suddenly, Black suggests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:16.240
that the company might have found a cure to&nbsp;
the newest deadly disease that has been killing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:21.360
millions of people around the world. Dark is&nbsp;
suddenly intrigued and asks Black more about it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:26.320
This makes White suspicious, so he asks&nbsp;
Dark if she is also infected by the virus.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.800
Dark says she isn’t and dismisses the&nbsp;
matter. To take the attention off her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:35.200
she approaches the guard and brings a lighter&nbsp;
out of his pocket without talking to him. 
&nbsp;

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:39.680
Then, she glances at the fire alarm. The&nbsp;
group plans to use the lighter to trigger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:44.160
the sprinkler because water can potentially&nbsp;
develop the writings on the paper. For this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:49.120
Dark gets on top of a chair but doesn’t reach&nbsp;
the fire alarm. White helps her by giving her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:54.640
a rolled piece of paper that she lights up and&nbsp;
uses to trigger the alarm. Soon, water starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:59.840
showering but the papers stay the same. Suddenly,&nbsp;
the guard makes his way to the group. Right then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:05.680
Dark unfolds the paper in her hand and reveals it&nbsp;
to be her own. White had betrayed her to loosen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:11.040
the competition. The guard drags Dark away&nbsp;
as she calls White a bastard. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:16.080
an enraged Black says he will punch white&nbsp;
lights out. This makes the lights go out and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:20.240
the group figures they are voice-activated. 
They ask each other to be careful with what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:25.520
they say when Deaf starts to cry again. White&nbsp;
slyly sits in front of him and bullies the poor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:31.360
guy into tearing his own paper and eating it. The&nbsp;
guard approaches Deaf and sends him away as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:36.240
Now only five of the candidates are left. Black&nbsp;
belittles White for being an awful person but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:40.800
white insists they should thank him for getting&nbsp;
their competitors out. He also claims that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:45.840
knows what the question is but refuses to tell&nbsp;
the others. In a fit of rage, Black knocks him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:51.040
out with a single punch. The group then ties&nbsp;
him to a seat and covers his mouth with a tie.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:56.480
A while later, White gains consciousness. Brunette&nbsp;
removes his gag and he asks for his medication,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:01.760
saying that he is also infected with the virus and&nbsp;
has to take medicine every hour for him to live.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:06.480
Back searches for pills in his pocket but doesn’t&nbsp;
find one. This makes the group believe that White&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:11.040
is just making excuses so they would free&nbsp;
him. However, White claims that one of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:15.200
has taken the pill and promises to tell them&nbsp;
what the question is if they give it back.
&nbsp;

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:21.120
Soon, he loses consciousness again and starts&nbsp;
to tremble. Some believe he is faking but Balck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:25.360
says that he is getting a seizure because of the&nbsp;
virus. They start looking for the pill he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:30.320
talking about but cannot find it in the room. With&nbsp;
only fifteen minutes left on the timer, they check&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:35.360
each other for the pill. Brunette suspects Brown&nbsp;
for taking it and is proven right when she finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:40.720
the pill stuck to a chewing gum under his table.&nbsp;
She tries to feed it to white but Brown throws it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:45.520
into a vent. As the others try to get it out, a&nbsp;
stressed Brunette goes in front of the camera and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:50.480
asks the invigilator to save the man. But since&nbsp;
she talked to the invigilator, she is immediately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:56.560
disqualified. After she is gone, Blonde brings the&nbsp;
pill out with a bobby pin and saves White’s life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.560 --> 00:10:01.120
She also unties him in the process.
After he recovers, everyone asks him for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:05.920
the answer he promised. White reveals that the&nbsp;
answers are the candidates themselves. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:10.240
have been searching for a question all this time&nbsp;
but White thinks that there is no question and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:15.760
the one who is left at the end is the answer. The&nbsp;
rest of them believe him but before they can act,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:21.120
White runs to get the gun from the guard. Black&nbsp;
pushes him aside and acquires the gun himself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:25.840
He points it at White who confidently claims&nbsp;
that he won’t shoot anyone. Simultaneously,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:31.440
he attacks Black and gets the gun. However, when&nbsp;
he is about to use it he realizes the gun has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:37.280
fingerprint recognition. So, White uses the guard&nbsp;
and points the gun at the others. He threatens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:42.240
everyone to get out of the room on their own so he&nbsp;
can win the position. Brown doesn’t retaliate with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:47.680
the fear of being shot and deliberately walks&nbsp;
out. A scared blonde slowly walks outside but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:53.280
yells “lights out” at the end. The room goes pitch&nbsp;
dark making White shoot in random directions. 
&nbsp;

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:58.720
When the lights come back, Black falls limp on the&nbsp;
floor with a bullet hole on his chest. White looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:03.920
around and sees Blonde still has a foot inside the&nbsp;
room. He is about to shoot her as well but notices&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:09.280
that the timer has stopped. Now, White walks&nbsp;
to the camera and tells the invigilator that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:14.320
is the winner of the competition. The guard&nbsp;
approaches him and shows him the time. White&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:19.360
is in shock to see they still have twenty seconds&nbsp;
left, meaning that he is disqualified for talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:24.160
to the invigilator. It is then revealed that&nbsp;
Deaf had changed the time when they were busy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:30.000
discussing other things. At last, the only one&nbsp;
left is blonde. She walks into the room and picks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:35.120
up Deaf’s glasses that had fallen while he was&nbsp;
being taken out. Using those, she looks at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:40.640
paper and sees “question 1” written on it.
To her uttermost surprise, Deaf enters the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:46.480
room revealing that he is the CEO of the company&nbsp;
and was in the test to keep an eye on everyone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:52.640
Blonde walks up to him and says “no”. The CEO and&nbsp;
the invigilator smile, seeing that she has figured&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:57.360
out the question and passed the test. It turns&nbsp;
out when the invigilator asked them “if they had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:01.840
any questions” at the beginning of the test,&nbsp;
it was the only question they had to answer.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:07.360
The whole exam was set to test the candidates’&nbsp;
intelligence and attentiveness. They hire Blonde&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:11.920
as the CEO’s secretary but she doesn’t accept&nbsp;
the job because she doesn’t want to work with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:16.960
an organization that kills people. The invigilator&nbsp;
reveals that Black isn’t really dead and that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:22.000
bullet he got hit with is a capsule that heals&nbsp;
the wound after penetrating the body. It is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:26.800
actually the magical medicine they have recently&nbsp;
manufactured which can cure any disease in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:33.200
world. At last, Blonde accepts the job and the&nbsp;
movie ends as she shakes hands with the CEO.
&nbsp;

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.160
Subscribe for more videos like&nbsp;
this, turn on the notification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:39.920
